{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vape Shop Simulator is a first-person simulation game where you sell vapes and vaping related products to earn money and grow your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Manage The Shop:</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Order products, stock the shelves, and serve customers at the checkout. Run every part of the store and reinvest the profits into shop upgrades.<br>Brand Deals: Sign contracts with brands to gain access to new products to sell. The more variety you have, the more customers you will attract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/actual_real_gif_1.gif?t=1747953554\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Expand Your Business:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your store in size and in profit. Increase the amount of floor space available to support more quantity and variety of stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/actual_gif_2.gif?t=1747953554\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Hire Employees:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share the workload. Increase your shops productivity by having employees perform tasks like operating the checkouts or stocking the shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725420/extras/actual_gif_3.gif?t=1747953554\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Protect Your Business:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your profits from thieves who will try to take from your shop and leave without paying.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725420?t=1747953554","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/